## Variant spellings common in court decisions.
## red is ret's bare form as court decisions write it; ret's suffixed forms spell themselves
## (reddi, reddine), so red takes none: with NoVoicing the non-word redi read as ret+P3sg.
red [A:NoSuffix; Ref:ret]
tesbit [A:NoVoicing; Ref:tespit]
irad [A:NoVoicing; Ref:irat]

## Names missing from the person-name list.
Salih [P:Noun,Prop]
Ali [P:Noun,Prop]

